    "title": "When is the World Baseball Classic championship? Time, TV schedule, channel, live stream for 2026 WBC final",
    "text": "When is the World Baseball Classic championship? Time, TV schedule, channel, live stream for 2026 WBC final originally appeared on The Sporting News. Add The Sporting News as a Preferred Source by clicking here.The twists and turns of the 2026 World Baseball Classic already have produced numerous memorable moments, with more still to come as a champion is crowned.AdvertisementOne thing we already know is a new team will lift the trophy this year after reigning champion Japan fell to Venezuela in the quarterfinals. Japan won three of the previous five WBCs, so its failure to even reach the semis was a shock.The only other nations with a title to their credit are the United States and the Dominican Republic, and Team USA will try to add a second title to go with its 2017 crown after squeaking past the D.R. in the first semifinal. Venezuela ended Italy's magical run in the other semi and is guaranteed its best WBC finish after previously topping out in third place in 2009.But when is that final matchup? Here's everything you need to know about the 2026 WBC finale.Date: Tuesday, March 17Time: 8 p.m. ETAdvertisementThe 2026 World Baseball Classic championship game is set to begin at 8 p.m. ET on Tuesday, March 17. The game will be played at loanDepot Park in Miami.Where to watch World Baseball Classic finalTV channel: FoxLive stream: FuboThe 2026 World Baseball Classic championship game will be broadcast by Fox and can be streamed live via Fubo.Fubo offers a free trial for new subscribers, so you can try the service before you buy. Stream ESPN, ABC, CBS, Fox and 100+ top channels of live TV and sports without cable. (Participating plans only. Taxes and fees may apply.)World Baseball Classic final radio coverageFans can listen to the 2026 World Baseball Classic final live on SiriusXM.AdvertisementNew subscribers can listen to SiriusXM for free for four months. Listen to live NFL, MLB, NBA and NHL games, plus NASCAR, college sports and more. Stay updated with all the news and get all the analysis on multiple sport-specific channels.World Baseball Classic playoff schedule, scores 2026Friday, March 13 - QuarterfinalsGameTime (ET)TV/StreamDominican Republic 10, Korea 0 (7 inn.)——USA 5, Canada 3——Saturday, March 14 - QuarterfinalsGameTime (ET)TV/StreamItaly 8, Puerto Rico 6——Venezuela 8, Japan 5——Sunday, March 15 - SemifinalsSemifinals and championship will be played in MiamiGameTime (ET)TV/StreamUSA 2, Dominican Republic 1——Monday, March 16 - SemifinalsGameTime (ET)TV/StreamVenezuela 4, Italy 2——Tuesday, March 17 - ChampionshipGameTime (ET)TV/StreamUSA vs. Venezuela8 p.m.Fox, FuboWorld Baseball Classic winners listHere are the winners and runners-up for the first five editions of the WBC.YearChampionRunner-up2023JapanUnited States2017United StatesPuerto Rico2013Dominican RepublicPuerto Rico2009JapanSouth Korea2006JapanCubaRelated Links",
